<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Dec manufacturing prices up 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Dec manufacturing prices up 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian manufacturing output prices rose 0.1 percent in December from the previous month and stood 0.2 percent above their level of a year before, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said on Friday.</p>
</text>
